Results !\u003d null) {\n+            if (allowPartialResultsInBody) {\n+                builder.field(\"allow_partial_search_results\", String.valueOf(allowPartialSearchResults));\n+                if (allowPartialSequenceResults !\u003d null) {\n+                    builder.field(\"allow_partial_sequence_results\", String.valueOf(allowPartialSequenceResults));","submitted_line":194},"generatedCommentsNodes":[]},{"groundTruth":{"original_line":31,"line":31,"comment_lines":["[][31]"],"review_comment":["It would be great if all the existent tests in EQL that have no idea about partial results (all the tests based on BaseEqlSpecTestCase before this PR) would completely randomize these two new settings. All of them should behave completely the same because we have no \"broken\" shard setup for them which means that irrespective of the values provided, the tests should pass.","There is some randomization already, but I\u0027m making it more complete. "],"path":"x-pack/plugin/eql/qa/common/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/test/eql/EqlMissingEventsSpecTestCase.java","id":36779,"created_at":"2024-12-05T16:57:07Z","original_position":6,"side":"RIGHT","position":6,"submitted_on_commit":"7efff369d1080a955e8bfabf5d2dbb606aa1ce45","diff_hunk":"@@ -27,9 +27,23 @@ public EqlMissingEventsSpecTestCase(\n         List\u003clong[]\u003e eventIds,\n         String[] joinKeys,\n         Integer size,\n-        Integer maxSamplesPerKey\n+        Integer maxSamplesPerKey,\n+        Boolean allowPartialSearchResults,","submitted_line":31},"generatedCommentsNodes":[]},{"groundTruth":{"original_line":143,"line":143,"comment_lines":["[][143]"],"review_comment":["Awesome 👍 "],"path":"x-pack/plugin/eql/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/eql/execution/sequence/PITFailureTests.java","id":36780,"created_at":"2024-12-05T17:40:56Z","original_position":20,"side":"RIGHT","position":20,"submitted_on_commit":"7efff369d1080a955e8bfabf5d2dbb606aa1ce45","diff_hunk":"@@ -132,7 +134,15 @@ public void test